  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "種一坵友善ê田"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<b>作者：Lîm Tsìn Khun</b><br />\n<b><br /></b>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhb9BWic0GqNj-bES3mePqnW8OmHplvfXgoWFgm7tIv_bdMw3qnfOsdi7yRUtS74tJYrfCXjUW82PP76LmFb_E7RLteQ-d1QwhxvXtHuLu-ZXviEeObzEscj8ndDVH09Ir9bMj63JzxnE-4/s1600/%25E5%258F%25B0%25E8%25AA%259E%25E6%25A3%25B2%25E5%259C%25B0-10-01.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"836\" data-original-width=\"1600\" height=\"334\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhb9BWic0GqNj-bES3mePqnW8OmHplvfXgoWFgm7tIv_bdMw3qnfOsdi7yRUtS74tJYrfCXjUW82PP76LmFb_E7RLteQ-d1QwhxvXtHuLu-ZXviEeObzEscj8ndDVH09Ir9bMj63JzxnE-4/s640/%25E5%258F%25B0%25E8%25AA%259E%25E6%25A3%25B2%25E5%259C%25B0-10-01.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div>\n<b><br /></b>\n<br />\n<br />\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n利用無農藥、無化肥ê方式種作，一年ke五个人，一个人種兩甲，20年後就有兩百甲--ah！Tse就是「倆佰甲」 ê 初心。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n逐工下早仔出門，曾文昌先生就ē看著路邊有一坵田ê阿伯，m̄是tng-teh噴藥仔，就是噴了leh洗伊 ê五馬仔<span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><b>（註）</b></span>。伊mā bat 看過一坵田，明明已經鋪網仔--ah，田主mā是leh噴藥仔。所以有人leh講庄跤ê空氣其實khah bái，因為農藥khah濟。有人統計，世界上農藥ê用量台灣排第一，一公頃平均一年ài用17公斤（日本排第二，mā tsiah 11公斤），án-ne算--起-來一个人一年ài食450公克ê農藥，實在驚--人。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n2012 hit年，一陣年歲uì十幾歲到60幾歲、無仝職業、無仝國家ê人做伙成立「倆佰甲」tsit个團體。In特別選「倆佰」tsit兩字，內底有四个人，代表有一陣人，希望透過合作ê方式，推廣友善種作ê理念。若是有人想beh作田，in就ē kap對方面談，了解伊ê個性、目標kap經驗，tsiah來tàu揣適合ê田地hōo伊種作。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n曾文昌先生加入「倆佰甲」了後，除了種稻仔、種菜，mā tsiok注重田坵生態ê復育，所以tī伊ê田底，ē-sái揣著雨傘節、kap-mé-á（四跤仔tī彰化鹿港ê講法）、毛蟹、鱔魚、田pe、蜊仔、田嬰。因為希望家己除了ē-hiáu種，koh ài ē-hiáu買、ē-hiáu煮，所以伊koh有飼雞、飼蜂，透過tsia-ê過程來了解無仝產業ê mê角。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n為著beh hōo在地ê囡仔koh-khah了解家己ê故鄉，曾文昌先生ē tshuā in去清水路，甚至去國校做食農教育、教囡仔種稻仔。Uì浸種、做秧仔埕、掖米糠、紡田、播田、khioh福壽螺、挲草、熟sāi雜草kap病蟲害、割稻仔、包裝到銷售，hōo囡仔完整ê體驗。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n最後，曾文昌先生希望逐家ē-tàng去思考：「Lán想beh留啥mih款ê環境hōo lán ê後代？」&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">註：五馬仔（gōo-bé-á），一種小型ê農業機器，台灣已經無leh生產，因為ē-sái透過簡單ê改裝來處理無仝款ê農事，雖然講已經是古董，但是tī細坵田也是tsiok好用。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">編按：本文是10/18棲地復育台語講座－種一坵友善ê田講座摘要記錄，講者曾文昌是倆佰甲小農負責人。台灣蠻野心足生態協會舉辦ê「蠻野講堂」tuì 2019年3月份起kap李江却台語文教基金會合辦規劃十場有關生態環境議題ê台語講座，歡迎逐家tī逐個月第三禮拜五暗時七點到九點，同齊來「呷米共食廚房」（台北市中正區衡陽路9號3樓）擴展家己ê台語棲地（tshe-tē）！詳細資料ē-tàng看「台灣蠻野心足生態協會」FB專頁。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEisxp-72qfTxGLL9ZL7HN2lUdp49FoT7p-MqIzldwOu_6MDTxnw2uFTu8N06wHWvfJrzC_KB9FH28c_im0vzr6EssLSUXNR5BM9CIYw5fyXIHPoO5FxEo4U8jzq8PMptLHW9sPm5wuKdmlQ/s1600/%25E5%258F%25B0%25E8%25AA%259E%25E6%25A3%25B2%25E5%259C%25B0A4-02_0.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1600\" data-original-width=\"1132\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEisxp-72qfTxGLL9ZL7HN2lUdp49FoT7p-MqIzldwOu_6MDTxnw2uFTu8N06wHWvfJrzC_KB9FH28c_im0vzr6EssLSUXNR5BM9CIYw5fyXIHPoO5FxEo4U8jzq8PMptLHW9sPm5wuKdmlQ/s640/%25E5%258F%25B0%25E8%25AA%259E%25E6%25A3%25B2%25E5%259C%25B0A4-02_0.jpg\" width=\"452\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><span style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot; , &quot;trebuchet&quot; , &quot;verdana&quot; , sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;\"><b>#</b></span></span><span style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot; , &quot;trebuchet&quot; , &quot;verdana&quot; , sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;\"><b>棲地復育台語講座專欄，</b></span><span style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot; , &quot;trebuchet&quot; , &quot;verdana&quot; , sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;\"><b>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案</b></span><b style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;\">。</b></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報308期，2019年11月出刊。</b></span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; text-align: justify;\">\n--------------------------------------------</div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"color: #38761d; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fF5bhx</a></span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">線上捐款(單筆)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2Ffcycox&amp;h=AT0H6xWALxkqKTZY4xK9Odg526LM77N2q_ltt_Y8nC4_ki5ZoWyAjPPNaKyF6_djXJ_obDEOkx__7WMdaTUsGNOmfg_FDe_nfhDB9cW9M2iyHMHquKL9nqCFMpuMwCF5Gby8kOWjHu6nBgAoYPsZcF2smrFzZVzSNSg15gjibmTXy4sSPf6SrWMQHmUCH9xNvWH_NU1Wp9NzumavCiqfcj4T6os_JW-iktTbi7Rur82KNucjaugBeLf4yIkaMCU_vybvXjKVnWWUq5pAwuVuMCebZdM-rH__LgvZR9zWIlivnX_lBELOjpKo7-lDzasSyJI8UDxgBUsDYSi-TXAqb1moHrcCZPU9DgyiIg0Dl63KER-NQMuehP5AjqLfKITfoVoc9ZXFfr-BItslSWP-mplFEqq82MBwmXwrembzOg-5Qu2qNvQfpLqoI5tvIIN0U_ZNfMHNfcND0dHoyuXmvOdmELx6ODOh4GLkH8uxKdg8hAgwf6LsFQVFWT-8hoopqCulWayrSYRFDyon9I6G-w1eBkO9iWtohOpq8XEA05uL2v6-oh4pTr5QYdobVfeqArrNaSvWLrvE4cL1ci5n7zIes4NNv3dRAAgdx4wRiKX-0e6xJla9fe2ZTCOTyQsZEuUGrdmWYe2l7e4iCwc\" href=\"https://ppt.cc/fcycox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"color: #38761d; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fcycox</a></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"></span><br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"></span><br /></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: xx-small;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span><br />\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: xx-small;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: xx-small;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: xx-small;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: xx-small;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div>\n<br /></div>\n"
